{
 "about": "Event engine (bullets). Official feeds read every poll_market_s seconds in market hours (poll_other_s otherwise); every item is saved with the day's data and matched to F&O symbols by name. impact: words that make an item high or medium impact; skip: words that make it noise. only_if (per source): keep an item only if its title has one of these words (PIB publishes everything the government does). Event risk on every alert and test signal comes from: India's scheduled days (rules/events.json: RBI policy, Budget...), high-impact world events in the next global_window_min minutes (economic calendar), the stock's results / board meeting, expiry day, the F&O ban list, a market holiday tomorrow, and fresh official items (fresh_min_symbol minutes for one naming the stock, fresh_min_market for market-wide ones). It is information and warnings only: it never blocks an alert or a trade. telegram_high: a new high-impact official item naming an F&O stock, or hitting the whole market, is sent to Telegram (at most telegram_per_hour).",
 "sources": [
  {"name": "RBI press releases", "who": "RBI", "url": "https://www.rbi.org.in/pressreleases_rss.xml"},
  {"name": "RBI notifications", "who": "RBI", "url": "https://www.rbi.org.in/notifications_rss.xml"},
  {"name": "SEBI", "who": "SEBI", "url": "https://www.sebi.gov.in/sebirss.xml"},
  {"name": "Government (PIB)", "who": "Government", "url": "https://www.pib.gov.in/RssMain.aspx?ModId=6&Lang=1&Regid=3&reg=3",
   "only_if": ["gst", "tax", "duty", "tariff", "finance", "economy", "economic", "inflation", "gdp", "fiscal", "disinvestment", "bank",
               "rbi", "sebi", "pli", "cabinet approves", "defence", "railway", "power", "petroleum", "coal", "steel", "telecom",
               "pharma", "export", "import", "fdi", "budget", "subsidy", "msp", "monsoon", "trade deal", "auto", "semiconductor"]},
  {"name": "NSE circulars", "who": "NSE", "url": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/RSS/Circulars.xml"},
  {"name": "BSE notices", "who": "BSE", "url": "https://www.bseindia.com/data/xml/notices.xml",
   "only_if": ["derivative", "f&o", "margin", "trading", "suspension", "surveillance", "ban", "circuit", "settlement"]}
 ],
 "impact": {
  "high": ["repo rate", "monetary policy", "policy rate", "crr", "slr", "cancellation of licence", "cancels licence", "cancels the licence",
